(7563573, 1213027, 159132, '<td valign="top">PP comments: Nice macro, excellent bokeh. Color and detail of leaf is enticing.<br/> <br/>Taste/composition comments: I was thinking the wasteland that this is resurrecting into could have been more prominent or recognizably supporting the allegory.<br/> <br/>Can''t tell if the base is a tree, rock, or ?</td>', 'PP comments: Nice macro, excellent bokeh. Color and detail of leaf is enticing. Taste/composition comments: I was thinking the wasteland that this is resurrecting into could have been more prominent or recognizably supporting the allegory. Can''t tell if the base is a tree, rock, or ?', '2018-03-21 23:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7563576, 1212998, 159132, '<td valign="top">Technically, excellent still life, texture is warm and deep. Beautiful really. The allegory composition seems too complicated, like trying to tell the whole story in one jumble</td>', 'Technically, excellent still life, texture is warm and deep. Beautiful really. The allegory composition seems too complicated, like trying to tell the whole story in one jumble', '2018-03-21 23:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
