(7564634, 1212762, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that fulfils the challenge brief well<br/> <br/>Nicely composed image Anton. Together with your title the end result portrays the illusion that the house has been built on the road itself. The foreground road sweeping in towards the house leads you nicely into the image as a whole. It works well.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that fulfils the challenge brief well Nicely composed image Anton. Together with your title the end result portrays the illusion that the house has been built on the road itself. The foreground road sweeping in towards the house leads you nicely into the image as a whole. It works well.', '2018-04-02 13:31:33.000000', NULL, 0);
